'''Fossil Muncher''' is an [[NPC]] located in the {{Zone|Glacite Tunnels}}, near some Onyx Gemstones. They ask for a random [[Fossils|Fossil]] every {{Green|24h}} and rewards the player with {{Glacite Powder|25,000}} and {{Item|Fossil Essence|amount=100}} upon being given the requested item.

